//! Pushdown Automaton (PDA) Delimiter Context Stack.
//! Inspired by Sublime Text / Tree-sitter pushdown lexers.
//! Fast character codes, constant sets, and patterns for the CST parser and discipline rules.
//! Fast single-pass mathematical Concrete Syntax Tree (CST) Parser.
//! Delimiter pushdown automaton, balanced group parsing, and pure AST construction.
//! Super-Family 1, Discipline 1.1: Calculus Foundations.
//! Intervals, Evaluation Bars, and Higher-Order Derivatives.
//! Super-Family 1, Discipline 1.2: Complex Analysis.
//! Wirtinger derivatives, Residues, Singularity Poles, Conjugates, Imaginary Unit, Principal Values.
//! Super-Family 2, Discipline 2.1 & 2.2: Continuum Mechanics & Transport.
//! Domain Boundaries, Interface Jumps/Averages, Convective Advection, Wave D'Alembertian, Contraction, Dimensionless.
//! Super-Family 3, Discipline 3.1: Dynamical Systems.
//! Symplectic Poisson Brackets, Flow Evolution, Invariant Manifolds, Wronskian Determinants.
//! Super-Family 3, Discipline 3.2: Optimization & Variational Analysis.
//! Subdifferentials, Fenchel Duals, KKT Multipliers, Proximal Operators, Regularization Norms.
//! Super-Family 4, Discipline 4.1: Differential Geometry & Tensor Calculus.
//! Contravariant Indices, Comma/Semicolon Index Differentiation, Musical Isomorphisms, Exterior Calculus.
//! Super-Family 4, Discipline 4.2: Algebraic Topology.
//! Nilpotent Chain Boundaries, Connected Sums, Cup/Cap Products, Topological Invariants.
//! Super-Family 5, Discipline 5.1: Linear & Multilinear Algebra.
//! Matrix Determinants, Matrix Transformations, Matrix Norms, Tensor Products (Kronecker & Hadamard).
//! Super-Family 5, Discipline 5.2: Abstract Algebra.
//! Subgroup Indices, Normal Subgroup Relations, Injective/Surjective Morphisms.
//! Super-Family 5, Discipline 5.3: Number Theory & Arithmetic.
//! Legendre Symbols, Modular Congruences, p-Adic Norms, Divisibility Relations, Arithmetic Functions.
//! Super-Family 5, Discipline 5.4: Mathematical Logic & Set Theory.
//! Quantifiers, Turnstiles, Set Difference.
//! Super-Family 6, Discipline 6.1: Quantum Mechanics.
//! Dirac Bra-Ket Ecosystem, Commutators, Anticommutators, Ladder Operators, Pauli Matrices.
//! Super-Family 6, Discipline 6.2: Probability Theory & Statistics.
//! Conditioning Bars, Probability & Expectation Operators.
//! Super-Family 6, Discipline 6.3: Stochastic Calculus.
//! Wiener Processes, Stratonovich Differentials, Quadratic Variations.
//! Tree-sitter style priority-cascade span collector for CST nodes.
